      "start_seconds": 6.32,
      "end_seconds": 9.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "doctor thank you for seeing us"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.62,
      "end_seconds": 13.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "tell me from the beginning, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 15.96,
      "end_seconds": 20.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "He's been having numb patches on both feet doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.14,
      "end_seconds": 23.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Since when have you had this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.21,
      "end_seconds": 26.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "it's been ten days now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.0,
      "end_seconds": 33.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.32,
      "end_seconds": 60.43,
      "duration_seconds": 24.11,
      "text": "I'd say all the time. And And there's dry cracked heels as well, two weeks now. As for dry cracked heels, a three out of ten, I suppose. Moisturiser helps a bit. Oh, and a small sore on the sole that is slow to heal. Had that since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.15,
      "end_seconds": 67.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "have you had numb patches on both feet before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.02,
      "end_seconds": 76.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "yes something like this happened last winter and it went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 84.14,
      "end_seconds": 98.41,
      "duration_seconds": 14.27,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier saturation 99 percent, weight 72 kilos, BP is 163 over 99, BMI works out to 26.1, temperature is 36.8 degrees, height 166 centimetres, heart rate 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.02,
      "end_seconds": 101.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "good thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.77,
      "end_seconds": 106.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I'll examine you now bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.36,
      "end_seconds": 108.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.97,
      "end_seconds": 112.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Hold that position for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.98,
      "end_seconds": 136.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "there's a small shallow ulcer under the ball of the left foot no pus or surrounding redness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.79,
      "end_seconds": 139.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "tell me if anything hurts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.85,
      "end_seconds": 154.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Pulses at the ankle are weak."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.16,
      "end_seconds": 162.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "okay, finished have you had any pus or redness spreading up the foot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.3,
      "end_seconds": 169.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "I haven't had pus or redness spreading up the foot no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.83,
      "end_seconds": 179.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "okay, have you had any fever, smell from the foot, black skin or foot pain at rest?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.81,
      "end_seconds": 182.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.53,
      "end_seconds": 187.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.25,
      "end_seconds": 191.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.58,
      "end_seconds": 195.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.67,
      "end_seconds": 198.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "no um nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.79,
      "end_seconds": 204.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "right, tell me what you take day to day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.36,
      "end_seconds": 209.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Glycomet 500 milligrams twice a day for my sugar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 211.13,
      "end_seconds": 219.65,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "he is supposed to to take it twice a day but I can't say he always does"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.03,
      "end_seconds": 225.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Before this I was on glimepiride; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.84,
      "end_seconds": 229.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Moving on to your background any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.14,
      "end_seconds": 234.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure i have diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.87,
      "end_seconds": 242.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "right, so diabetes is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.17,
      "end_seconds": 257.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "before I prescribe anything, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.49,
      "end_seconds": 262.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I've never been told I have allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.95,
      "end_seconds": 267.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Any relatives with health problems I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.48,
      "end_seconds": 271.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "My mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.06,
      "end_seconds": 281.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "what's your diet like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.68,
      "end_seconds": 288.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "I eat out quite a lot, to be honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.78,
      "end_seconds": 295.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Any sport or activity?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.49,
      "end_seconds": 299.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "I play badminton on Sundays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.41,
      "end_seconds": 303.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Who do you live with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.33,
      "end_seconds": 310.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "I live with my family, my husband and two kids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.91,
      "end_seconds": 313.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.35,
      "end_seconds": 318.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.71,
      "end_seconds": 350.4,
      "duration_seconds": 30.69,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, my working impression is a diabetic foot ulcer with some circulation concern. Another possibility is an infected wound. We should do a Doppler scan of the leg for poor pulses. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. We should do a foot X-ray for foot ulcer. Look at your feet every day with a mirror and never go barefoot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.14,
      "end_seconds": 361.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.46,
      "text": "Let's get you seen by the the podiatry clinic I'll arrange the letter. We'll catch up in two weeks. Thanks for coming in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.49,
      "end_seconds": 369.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Uh, nothing more from me, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.85,
      "end_seconds": 371.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "see you then"
    }
  ]
